OL,5,G2225 Chicago PD
OL,6,     FChicago District 21 has two police
OL,7,     Fgroups: uniformed cops who dream
OL,8,     Fof moving up, and the intelligence
OL,9,     Funit. With both facing danger and
OL,10,     Fdrama, life on the job is a daily
OL,11,     Fchallenge
